        "url": "https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Map_of_the_operations_of_the_Tirah_Field_Force_of_1897%E2%80%9398_during_the_Tirah_campaign_in_Tirah,_North-West_Frontier_of_India,_mapped_by_John_Fawkes.jpg"
      },
